1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,204
Before leaving, open Devices on the PC and select your paired device.

2
00:00:05,154 --> 00:00:08,402
Check that View PC screen is allowed.

3
00:00:08,402 --> 00:00:16,018
The Remote controls profile blocks screen viewing; use the device's Custom permissions to allow the access you need.

4
00:00:16,018 --> 00:00:20,631
Pointer and keyboard permission is also needed to control the PC.

